e enough to justify looking at the four together, without yet proving one operation.\n\nRESULT CF-069 | A1: Yes | A2: Cannot tell | A3: No, not by itself | A4: Yes, weakly | A5: Yes | B1: Yes | B2: No | B3: Yes | B4: Cannot tell | B5: No | B6: Yes"
